        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Unfinished embroidery on white silk gauze depicting a bird in vibrant colours perched on a branch observing a butterfly, overlaying the original gouache-on-paper design and framed together with it in a black narrow frame and glazed with black glass, the centre in a clear oval bordered with gold."@en ;
